Notes for redistribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Because the pinned upstream sources are AGPL-3.0, every distributed copy of the
  compiled artifacts above (`packages/spqr-wasm/dist/spqr.wasm`,
  `packages/keytrans-wasm/dist/keytrans.wasm`) and of the `kt-query` binary is a
  distribution of AGPL-3.0 code. Corresponding source is the upstream repository at
  the pinned commit listed above (plus this repository's thin wrappers).
* Rebuilding the artifacts requires those checkouts at the pinned commits
  (see each `build.sh` and `README.md`); CI does not rebuild them, it uses the
  committed artifacts.
* Keep this file together with `LICENSE` in any redistribution.

Pins are recorded here and in `docs/30` §30.2; repository layout and root-policy
files are catalogued in `docs/25`.
